## PR Title
Evaluation of unknown values with FAIL_* macros

## PR Description
The PR implements proper handling of unknown ('x'/'z') values in the `FAIL_*` macro family so that comparisons follow SystemVerilog semantics. It addresses request #51 ("Unexpected == evaluation of unknown values with svunit_testcase::fail()"), where `==` against unknowns produced unexpected pass/fail outcomes.

